<!--
    events.xml — SERVER SETUP MERGED
    ==================================
    Full merged events.xml combining ALL animal spawn events and ALL vehicle
    spawn events for DayZ Chernarus+ (dayzOffline.chernarusplus).

    Sources merged:
      1. animals/realistic-wildlife-overhaul/events.xml
         - 13 animal events (AnimalHare through AnimalBear)
      2. vehicles/realistic-vehicle-overhaul/events.xml
         - 7 vehicle events (VehicleCivilianParking through VehicleHighway)

    INSTALL PATH: mpmissions/dayzOffline.chernarusplus/db/events.xml
    This is a FULL REPLACEMENT file — replace the original entirely.

    ANIMAL NOMINAL COUNTS (active on map at any time):
      Hare         80  — most common, everywhere
      Roe Deer     50  — very common, rural/forest
      Red Deer     35  — common, inland/meadows
      Wild Boar    30  — moderately common, woodlands
      Hen          60  — common, settlements/farms
      Cattle       25  — farms and open fields
      Sheep/Goat   20  — farms and hillsides
      Pig          20  — mostly farms
      DomAnimals   25  — mixed, near villages
      Fox          30  — forest edges and farms
      Wolf         20  — predator, spread entire map
      Bear         15  — predator, rivers/forests/food sources

    VEHICLE NOMINAL COUNTS (active on map at any time per event type):
      VehicleCivilianParking    20
      VehicleRoadsideBreakdown  18
      VehicleGasStation         12
      VehicleIndustrial         10
      VehiclePoliceCheckpoint    8
      VehicleRuralFarm          14
      VehicleHighway            16
-->
